"nextNodeIds":[411300202]},{"nodeId":411300202,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4148156722,"text":"I've cleaned the monsters out.","nextNodeIds":[411300203]},{"nodeId":411300203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30014,"speakerName":"Jinglun","textMapHash":4241831970,"text":"Thank you very much, but I'm afraid there's been an emergency.","nextNodeIds":[411300204]},{"nodeId":411300204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30014,"speakerName":"Jinglun","textMapHash":1248924946,"text":"I'd assumed that the monsters around Qingce Village were all the ordinary sort...","nextNodeIds":[411300205]},{"nodeId":411300205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30014,"speakerName":"Jinglun","textMapHash":2716429530,"text":"I'd just led some troops to clean out one monster camp, and we were looking to get some rest before continuing.","nextNodeIds":[411300206]},{"nodeId":411300206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30014,"speakerName":"Jinglun","textMapHash":652857778,"text":"But that was when a Stonehide Lawachurl came charging out of the nearby woods...","nextNodeIds":[411300207]},{"nodeId":411300207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30014,"speakerName":"Jinglun","textMapHash":1409223610,"text":"It was upon us before we could even react, and many were injured... We were forced to fall back.","nextNodeIds":[411300208]},{"nodeId":411300208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30014,"speakerName":"Jinglun","textMapHash":1436718522,"text":"That monster is too huge a threat to be left alone, but the other detachments have yet to return from clearing their targets out...","nextNodeIds":[411300209]},{"nodeId":411300209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30014,"speakerName":"Jinglun","textMapHash":3215769562,"text":"Could you help us defeat that monster, Traveler?","nextNodeIds":[411300210,411300212]},{"nodeId":411300210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":549798594,"text":"You can count on me.","nextNodeIds":[411300211]},{"nodeId":411300211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30014,"speakerName":"Jinglun","textMapHash":2040617818,"text":"I will, thank you. I'm really sorry... This should have been our task.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":411300212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2136686970,"text":"How are the wounded?","nextNodeIds":[411300213]},{"nodeId":411300213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30014,"speakerName":"Jinglun","textMapHash":2782865090,"text":"We were able to get help in time, so no one is in serious danger... But they'll have trouble moving about for a while.","nextNodeIds":[411300214]},{"nodeId":411300214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30014,"speakerName":"Jinglun","textMapHash":2835549874,"text":"As such, I'm afraid it's all up to you, Traveler.","nextNodeIds":[411300215]},{"nodeId":411300215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30014,"speakerName":"Jinglun","textMapHash":2244696626,"text":"I'm very sorry. This should have been our duty...","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[4113002,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30014"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":4113004,"order":10,"stepDescription":"Defeat the opponents","stepDescTextMapHash":4240287396,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"4113004"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STY